
Central dashboard aggregation services (overview only).

### Purpose:
- Aggregate real-time summary data from all features (Last Activities, Sensors, Incidents)
- Subscribe to global alerts across departments (Police, Fire, Energy, Environment)
- Fetch quick stats for dashboard widgets (crime %, energy saving, air quality)

### Planned / expected logic:
- dashboardOverviewService.ts → aggregate Last Activities + state overview
- globalAlertsSubscriptionService.ts → cross-feature real-time alerts
